","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-17451"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-12-07T00:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:10:49Z","remediation":"立即将 WP Mailster 插件升级至 1.5.5 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在 WordPress 后台禁用 WP Mailster 插件，或通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则拦截对 /view/subscription/unsubscribe2.php 的 mes 参数请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://packetstormsecurity.com/files/145222/WordPress-WP-Mailster-1.5.4.0-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-mailster/#developers","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/8973","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-17451.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-17451.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-17451.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-17451.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-17451-2981.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-17451-2983.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2017-17451.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2017-17451.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2017/17xxx/CVE-2017-17451.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2017-17451.js","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2017/CVE-2017-17451.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0060.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0059","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0059.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-17092","title":"WordPress WordPress 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 4.9.1 之前版本中的 wp-includes/functions.php 文件未对 .js 文件上传要求 unfiltered_html 权限，导致拥有订阅者及以上权限的认证用户可上传包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的 .js 文件。当其他用户访问包含该恶意文件的页面时，脚本将在浏览器中执行，造成存储型跨站脚本攻击（XSS）。攻击者需拥有 WordPress 站点的最低级账号权限，且需诱使管理员或普通用户访问受影响页面。该漏洞影响 WordPress 4.8.3 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 5.4，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2017-17092"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-12-02T06:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:10:19Z","remediation":"升级 WordPress 至 4.9.1 或更高版本，该版本要求上传 .js 文件时具备 unfiltered_html 权限，从而修复跨站脚本攻击。如无法立即升级，可限制低权限用户上传 JavaScript 文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/102024","https://codex.wordpress.org/Version_4.9.1","https://github.com/WordPress/WordPress/commit/67d03a98c2cae5f41843c897f206adde299b0509","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2017/12/msg00019.html","https://wordpress.org/news/2017/11/wordpress-4-9-1-security-and-maintenance-release/","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/8966","https://www.debian.org/security/2018/dsa-4090","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-17092.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-17092.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-17092.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2017/17xxx/CVE-2017-17092.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2017/CVE-2017-17092.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/CVE-2017-17092.yaml","ht